q-question-1738328320455","name":"What is the duration of IT courses after 12th commerce?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The average duration of most IT courses is between 4-7 months. If you opt for a short course, it may span 1-3 months, while a diploma course can be between 4-10 months.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328332394","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328332394","name":"Which IT course has the best career scope for commerce students?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"IT courses like data analytics, web development, and digital marketing offer the best career scope and excellent career prospects.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328347319","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328347319","name":"Can I get a job after completing an IT course?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, many IT courses are career-oriented and provide professional certifications, so you are career-ready after completing the course. Courses like graphic designing, digital marketing, and web development are best for freshers to find immediate jobs.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328373289","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328373289","name":"What are the career options after IT courses?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"After completing IT courses, you can apply for various job opportunities, such as:<br\/>-Digital Marketer<br\/>-Web Developer<br\/>-SEO Analyst<br\/>-E-Commerce Specialist<br\/>-Data Analyst<br\/>-Graphic Designer<br\/>-Software Tester","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328405325","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328405325","name":"Are online IT courses worth it for commerce students?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Online IT courses from top-rated and credible institutions are highly beneficial and useful. You not only get the flexibility to learn at your convenience, but you can also build practical skills through hands-on projects, adding credibility to your portfolio and enhancing your resume.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328419529","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328419529","name":"Which IT course is the easiest for commerce students?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Courses like graphic design, digital marketing, and social media marketing are beginner-friendly and easiest for commerce students.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328435701","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328435701","name":"What certifications can enhance my IT career after 12th commerce?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Some valuable certifications include:<br\/>-Google Digital Marketing Certification<br\/>-Microsoft Excel Certification<br\/>-Adobe Photoshop\/Illustrator Certifications<br\/>-AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner<br\/>-HubSpot Inbound Marketing Certification","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328469192","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328469192","name":"Which IT courses are best for freelancing opportunities?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you are looking for freelance opportunities, you can apply for various courses, such as digital marketing, data analysis, web development, graphic design, animation and video editing, and content management.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328482571","position":11,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328482571","name":"Can I pursue an IT course without knowing programming?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can apply for most IT courses, such as digital marketing, data analysis, graphic designing, and e-commerce management, without programming knowledge. Most courses cover basics, starting every topic from scratch and gradually moving to more advanced topics.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328496824","position":12,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328496824","name":"Is a degree necessary to succeed in the IT field after commerce?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You don\u2019t need a college degree to be successful in the IT field. However, you must have skill-based certifications and hands-on experience that can outweigh formal education.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328515177","position":13,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328515177","name":"What are the salary prospects after completing IT courses?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Salary prospects after completing IT courses depend on the field and sector in which you work. For example, a graphic designer can earn between \u20b92-5 LPA, while a digital marketer can earn between \u20b9-7 LPA. The average salary of a web developer in the beginning is between \u20b94-7 LPA, whereas a data analyst can make between \u20b94-8 LPA.\u00a0","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328534412","position":14,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328534412","name":"Can I pursue IT courses along with my B.Com degree?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can pursue a part-time IT course with your B.Com degree. Prefer online courses as they provide you with the flexibility to learn anytime.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328559694","position":15,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/it-courses-after-12th-commerce\/#faq-question-1738328559694","name":"How can I start my IT career after completing 12th commerce?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Once you complete your 12th commerce, start exploring various courses and degrees you can pursue based on your interest. Apply for a suitable course and get certifications from a reputed institute. Gain hands-on experience, build a strong portfolio, and apply for freelance, internship, or beginner-level job opportunities.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4364","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/8"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4364"}],"version-history":[{"count":52,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4364\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22511,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4364\/revisions\/22511"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/16168"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4364"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4364"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4364"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}